Mechanism: under the global flip a Fourier character chi_S -> (-1)^|S| chi_S,
so sign symmetry kills ODD-|S| coefficients only.  The PAIR-BLIND directions are
|S| >= 3.  At k=3 the only one is |S|=3 (ODD -> killed).  At k=4 there is also
|S|=4 (EVEN -> survives).  So the k=3 vanishing is an accident of k=3.

